\par\par \b \uc2 EMERGING MARKETS-Turkish lira scales 6-month highs; EM stocks march higher\b0\par\par\uc2 513 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 16 Februar 2021\par 10:13\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright 2021 Thomson Reuters. All Rights Reserved. \par \par \uc2 * Recovery optimism dents safe-haven dollar\par \par \uc2 * Russian rouble hits 6-week highs, but gains limited\par \par \uc2 * EM stocks extend rally for 8th session running\par \par \uc2 By Susan Mathew\par \par \uc2 Feb 16 (Reuters) - The Turkish lira scaled over six-month highs on Tuesday amid hopes of tighter monetary policy, while Russia's rouble was bolstered by rising oil prices.\par \par \uc2 Vaccine rollouts and hopes of more stimulus kept up appetite for risk, denting the safe-haven dollar.\par \par \uc2 Stocks in the developing world scaled new highs, rising for the 11th session in 12 and marking their longest winning streak since June last year.\par \par \uc2 Ahead of a \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  rate decision meeting on Thursday, Turkey's lira firmed 0.5%. The bank is expected to keep rate unchanged at 17%.\par \par \uc2 Turkey's annual inflation climbed more than expected to some 15% last month and \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  governor \uc2 Naci Agbal\uc2  said a possible rate cut will not be on agenda for a long time this year. The bank held rates in January after hiking it by 675 basis points since November.\par \par \uc2 "From a nominal rate perspective, Turkey does look more attractive compared to other emerging markets because interest rates are already so high," said \uc2 Cristian Maggio\uc2 , head of emerging market strategy at \uc2 TD Securities\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 "Turkish inflation is also higher than South Africa and Russia, so real rates in Turkey also stand out, but not as much as nominal rates," he said. "So, if the dollar continues on its weakening path, then markets will look at Turkey with interest because it's a very attractive carry trade."\par \par \uc2 Crude exporter Russia's rouble hit its highest in six weeks as oil prices rose after a cold front shut wells and refineries in Texas, the biggest crude producing state in the United States, slimming supply.\par \par \uc2 Gains in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  were limited, however, as investors kept an eye out for sanctions after threats of the same by Western countries over the arrest of Kremlin critc \uc2 Alexei Navalny\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Maggio also points to a weakening correlation between oil prices and the rouble.\par \par \uc2 "Historically and even today Russia is an oil-dependent economy, but it is less so today than in the past. As this diversification out of the hydrocarbons sector continues, you will see an increasing decoupling of the rouble from the normal oil price dynamics."\par \par \uc2 The Polish zloty was flat against a steady euro. \b \highlight22\uc2 Poland\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  could \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets to keep the rising zloty in check, bank Vice President Marta Kightley said on Monday. The \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  is up about 1.8% so far this year and was last at 4.48 against the euro. For GRAPHIC on emerging market \b \highlight22\uc2 FX\b0 \highlight\uc2  performance 2020, see {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://tmsnrt.rs/2egbfVh"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 http://tmsnrt.rs/2egbfVh}}}\uc2  For GRAPHIC on MSCI emerging index performance 2020, see {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://tmsnrt.rs/2OusNdX"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://tmsnrt.rs/2OusNdX}}}\par \par \uc2 For TOP NEWS across emerging markets\par \par \uc2 For CENTRAL EUROPE market report, see\par \par \uc2 For TURKISH market report, see\par \par \uc2 For RUSSIAN market report, see\par \par \uc2 (Reporting by Susan Mathew in Bengaluru; Editing by Nick Macfie) \par \par \uc2 Released: 2021-2-16T10:13:49.000Z \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020210216eh2g01dgm\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
