\par\par \b \uc2 POLL-Zloty, crown to star among CEE  \highlight22\uc2 FX \highlight\uc2  in 2021\b0\par\par\uc2 493 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 8 Januar 2021\par 09:05\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright 2021 Thomson Reuters. All Rights Reserved. \par \par \uc2 * reuters://realtime/verb=Open/url=cpurl://apps.cp./Apps/\b \highlight22\uc2 fx\b0 \highlight\uc2 -polls?RIC=EURCZK= Euro/Czech crown\par \par \uc2 * reuters://realtime/verb=Open/url=cpurl://apps.cp./Apps/\b \highlight22\uc2 fx\b0 \highlight\uc2 -polls?RIC=EURHUF= Euro/Hungarian forint\par \par \uc2 * reuters://realtime/verb=Open/url=cpurl://apps.cp./Apps/\b \highlight22\uc2 fx\b0 \highlight\uc2 -polls?RIC=EURPLN= Euro/Polish zloty\par \par \uc2 * reuters://realtime/verb=Open/url=cpurl://apps.cp./Apps/\b \highlight22\uc2 fx\b0 \highlight\uc2 -polls?RIC=EURRON= Euro/Romanian leu\par \par \uc2 * reuters://realtime/verb=Open/url=cpurl://apps.cp./Apps/\b \highlight22\uc2 fx\b0 \highlight\uc2 -polls?RIC=EURRSD= Euro/Serbian dinar\par \par \uc2 PRAGUE, Jan 8 (Reuters) - The Polish zloty should strengthen almost 3% over the next year to lead gains among central European \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  as economies recover from the coronavirus pandemic, a Reuters poll showed.\par \par \uc2 With the launch of vaccinations against COVID-19 fuelling hopes for a global economic recovery in 2021, analysts saw central European \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  mostly benefiting.\par \par \uc2 The Jan. 4-7 poll saw the zloty rising 2.9% from Wednesday's close, to 4.40 to the euro, in the next 12 months.\par \par \uc2 The Czech crown was close behind, with a median forecast of 25.50 per euro, or a 2.6% gain over the midweek close. Hungary's forint was expected to rise 0.8% to 356.0 to the euro.\par \par \uc2 "Elimination of the major political uncertainties, including the U.S. elections and post-Brexit relations between the \uc2 EU\uc2  and Britain, in combination with progress in distribution and application of anti-COVID vaccines, should support positive sentiment on CEE \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 ," Radomir Jac, chief economist for Generali Investments CEE, said.\par \par \uc2 In \b \highlight22\uc2 Poland\b0 \highlight\uc2 , Jac said a question remained after \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  to weaken the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  by the country's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the past month, which could lead to a more cautious market view.\par \par \uc2 Governor \uc2 Adam Glapinski\uc2  said in an interview with financial news website Obserwator Finansowy, published in full on Tuesday, that the bank has been \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  since mid-December and could cut interest rates this quarter if there was a third pandemic wave.\par \par \uc2 Mateusz Sutowicz, a financial market analyst at Bank Millennium, said zloty firming would likely be slower than was expected previously "but the fundamentals that always win in the long-term will make the zloty stronger".\par \par \uc2 Elsewhere, Czech markets are betting on a rate hike later in 2021, adding support for the crown.\par \par \uc2 Analysts forecast a slightly firmer crown over the next 12 months than in the last poll a month ago. Hungary's forint was also seen a touch firmer over the coming year than previously but was seen lagging the crown and zloty's gains.\par \par \uc2 Romania's leu was seen as the biggest laggard, weakening 1.4% over the next year, to 4.94 to the euro, as concerns over the fiscal and current account deficits continue to weigh.\par \par \uc2 (For other stories from the January Reuters \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  poll:)\par \par \uc2 (Reporting by Jason Hovet and Mirka Krufova in Prague; Editing by Alison Williams) \par \par \uc2 Released: 2021-1-8T09:05:00.000Z \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020210108eh180119q\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
