\par\par \b \uc2 UPDATE 1-Polish central banker Lon would support rate cuts if needed\b0\par\par\uc2 244 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 4 Januar 2021\par 09:45\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright 2021 Thomson Reuters. All Rights Reserved. \par \par \uc2 (Adds details)\par \par \uc2 WARSAW, Jan 4 (Reuters) - Polish central banker Eryk Lon said on Monday he hoped there would be no need to cut rates this year, but that there should be no hesitation about doing so if it was necessary.\par \par \uc2 While Poland's benchmark interest rate had until recently been expected to stay at a record low of 0.1% for the foreseeable future, \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  governor \uc2 Adam Glapinski\uc2  said rate cuts were possible in the first quarter.\par \par \uc2 "I hope that the need to cut interest rates will not arise this year, but if it does, we should not hesitate and definitely use this reduction in the same way as you use a well-sharpened axe for chopping wood," Lon wrote in an article for financial news website wgospodarce.pl.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Poland\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets to weaken the Polish zloty in December, and Lon said the possibility of such \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  occurring was something market participants should get used to.\par \par \uc2 "Whether \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  will continue to be used in 2021 probably depends on various factors, but it is important that \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market participants already have a chance to mentally get used to the fact that the NBP may cleverly use the exchange rate channel," he wrote. (Reporting by Alan Charlish and Pawel Florkiewicz; Editing by Alison Williams and Ed Osmond) \par \par \uc2 Released: 2021-1-4T09:45:58.000Z \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020210104eh14016d1\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
