ght\uc2 ... it is not a big scale," Mateusz Sutowicz, an analyst with \uc2 Bank Millennium\uc2  said.\par \par \uc2 Glapinski also said that a planned package of increased government social spending would support economic growth. (Reporting by Marcin Goclowski and Joanna Plucinska; writing by Alan Charlish; Editing by Toby Chopra) \par \par \uc2 Released: 2019-3-14T12:29:19.000Z \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020190314ef3e023ji\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
