\par\par \b \uc2 POLL-Analysts see about one chance in four of Polish  \highlight22\uc2 FX intervention \highlight\uc2  this year\b0\par\par\uc2 633 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 14 April 2015\par 17:21\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright 2015 Thomson Reuters. All Rights Reserved.   \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par WARSAW, April 14 (Reuters) - A Reuters poll of analysts\par showed on Tuesday they see about one chance in four \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Poland\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 's\par \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  will \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervene\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  on the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  market to weaken the\par zloty this year.\par     The Polish zloty has tested the psychological level of 4.00\par against the euro on Tuesday, reaching its strongest level since\par late 2011. The \f28 \uc2 \f2 European \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Central Bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 's massive monetary stimulus\par programme has fuelled the gains.\par     "The is a risk that the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  may \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervene\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 ," said\par Magdalena Polan, an economist at \f28 \uc2 \f2 Goldman Sachs\f28 \uc2 \f2 . "If the zloty\par strengthens to 3.85 to the euro, the risk will rise."\par     The zloty has gained about 7 percent since the start of the\par year versus the euro and about 10 percent since late December.\par However, it  has weakened against the dollar and the Swiss franc\par compared with last year.\par     Only one analyst in the poll said the likelihood of an\par \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  this year is higher than 50 percent -- Mikael\par Johansson of the Swedish SEB bank saw a 60 percent chance.\par     "The \f28 \uc2 \f2 Polish \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  needs a higher level of inflation\par and may also have to use the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  weapon," Johansson said.\par     \par     RISK\par     The \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 's Monetary Policy Council announced an end\par of its monetary easing cycle last month, when it cut the\par benchmark interest rate to 1.50 percent. \par     But minutes from the meeting released later showed the\par majority of policymakers thought the announcement would not\par prevent stop them from adjusting if the economy suffered a\par strong shock. \par     Inflation in Poland stands at minus 1.6 percent, far below\par the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 's plus 2.5 percent target. A stronger zloty\par could depress prices further.\par     Governor \f28 \uc2 \f2 Marek Belka\f28 \uc2 \f2  said in March that a stronger zloty\par could trigger a spiral of deflation and economic weakness, but\par the likelihood was low. \par     Analysts uniformly expect no change when the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 \par announces its latest rate decision on Wednesday. Belka will most\par likely comment on the zloty at a post-meeting conference. \par     A quarterly poll of companies conducted by the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 \par showed in January 2015 that exports would become unprofitable if\par the zloty strengthened past 3.90 to the euro, about 2.5 percent\par from its current level.\par     In Poland, the Monetary Policy Council sets rates, but the\par \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  board conducts \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency interventions\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 . Belka heads\par both, but they have different members.\par     A member of the bank's board, Eugeniusz Gatnar, said on\par Monday the strengthening of the zloty versus the euro is not a\par problem because it is a result of the \f28 \uc2 \f2 European \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Central Bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 's\par quantitative easing programme. \par     Rates in Poland currently stand at an all time low, but are\par still high compared with the euro zone or the Czech Republic,\par where they are near zero.\par     In the poll, analysts were asked whether they expect the\par \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  to \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervene\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  on the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  market to weaken the\par zloty by the end of this year, and to attach a numerical\par probability to their response.\par     \par     TABLE WITH POLL RESULTS:\par  Do you expect \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Poland\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 's         YES    NO\par  \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  to \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervene\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  on         \par  the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  market by               \par  end-2015 to weaken the               \par  zloty? (pct likelihood)              \par                                         \par  AFS                              10     90\par  \f28 \uc2 \f2 Bank Millennium\f28 \uc2 \f2                   20     80\par  \f28 \uc2 \f2 Bank Ochrony Srodowiska\f28 \uc2 \f2           10     90\par  \f28 \uc2 \f2 Bank Pekao\f28 \uc2 \f2                        30     70\par  \f28 \uc2 \f2 Bank Pocztowy\f28 \uc2 \f2                     30     70\par  BGK                              25     75\par  \f28 \uc2 \f2 BNP Paribas\f28 \uc2 \f2                        0    100\par  BPS                               5     95\par  BZ WBK                           30     70\par  \f28 \uc2 \f2 Ceska Sporitelna\f28 \uc2 \f2                  35     65\par  \f28 \uc2 \f2 Credit Agricole\f28 \uc2 \f2                    5     95\par  \f28 \uc2 \f2 Goldman Sachs\f28 \uc2 \f2                     10     90\par  \f28 \uc2 \f2 ING Bank Slaski\f28 \uc2 \f2                   25     75\par  mBank                            20     80\par  \f28 \uc2 \f2 Moody's\f28 \uc2 \f2  Analytics                30     70\par  Plus Bank                        25     75\par  Raiffeisen                       10     90\par  SEB                              60     40\par                                            \par  AVERAGE                          21     79\par  MEDIAN                           23     77\par  MIN                               0     40\par  MAX                              60    100\par  \par  (Reporting by Marcin Goettig; Editing by Larry King)\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 Released: 2015-4-17T15:21:10.000Z   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020150414eb4e00hz9\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
