\par\par \b \uc2 Poland's c.bank not concerned about zloty - official\b0\par\par\uc2 239 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 29 Januar 2014\par 18:11\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2014 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2 WARSAW, Jan 29 (Reuters) - \uc2 Poland's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  is not worried about the zloty \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , because the fundamentals of the economy are strong and the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  weakened due to external factors, a member of the bank's board said.\par \par \uc2 Eugeniusz Gatnar also told state news agency PAP that a rise in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 's volatility would be a negative development, but there was no reason for concern for now.\par \par \uc2 The zloty has fallen 1.3 percent to 4.2150 to the euro since last Thursday, hit by turmoil in other emerging markets that led the \uc2 Turkish \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to an emergency rate hike to defend the tumbling lira \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 "Markets are nervous, investors act under the influence of emotions and there is herding among investors," Gatnar said. "Our fundamentals are strong though, so there are no reasons for zloty weakening."\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Poland\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  to support the zloty in June last year when it traded at around 4.3 zlotys to the euro. \uc2 Poland's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has repeatedly said that it is ready to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  to curb excessive volatility.\par \par \uc2 "We monitor the situation closely, as always. It would be a negative phenomenon if volatility increased. But for now we don't see a reason for concern, " Gatnar said. ($1 = 3.0910 Polish zlotys) (Reporting by Marcin Goclowski; Editing by Elaine Hardcastle)\par \par \uc2 Released: 2014-2-1T17:11:35.000Z   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020140129ea1t00ca2\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw205\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal3075\pichgoal600
